{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Robot finds and grabs object, checks properties, moves to destination, completes task. If it fails, scans area. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
